OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Ftonight with spells of rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle at times, initially for
OL,8,FCumbria and most persistent for the
OL,9,Fhigh ground then spilling southwards
OL,10,Fthrough the night. Becoming breezy by
OL,11,Fsunrise, particularly around the
OL,12,Fcoast. Feeling milder than last night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FAnother cloudy and breezy day
OL,15,Fon Monday with grey skies and showery
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain. Some brighter
OL,17,Fspells possible later with rain easing
OL,18,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
