OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fat first on Tuesday with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain but becoming bright and dry from
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Sunny spells
OL,9,Fthereafter, and isolated showers
OL,10,Fthrough Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,11,Fdropping to feel autumnal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
